{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/extras/1349382a6f0b61e90b43390e4fe9511c.poster.avif?t=1772250147\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/extras/1349382a6f0b61e90b43390e4fe9511c.webm?t=1772250147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/extras/1349382a6f0b61e90b43390e4fe9511c.mp4?t=1772250147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 \u300cRhythm Hotel\u300dis a rhythm game bursting with wildly unpredictable, absurdly hilarious storylines. Socrates' &quot;kicking the donkey&quot; philosophy, Zhang Fei who said &quot;Me too!&quot; during the Oath of the Peach Garden, Einstein photographed only from the waist up.\u00a0The playable demo offers a taste of the bizarre, darkly humorous rhythm challenges waiting inside this fantastical inn bursting with whimsy and beats. The full version will deliver over 20 wildly unique rhythm mini-games, each with its own ridiculous story!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Step into \ud83c\udfb5Rhythm Hotel\ud83c\udfb5 \u2014 where every tap launches a rhythm-fueled adventure!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/extras/08d6420fd8a28b607f9f314ae0b75f8a.poster.avif?t=1772250147\" width=1170 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/extras/08d6420fd8a28b607f9f314ae0b75f8a.webm?t=1772250147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/extras/08d6420fd8a28b607f9f314ae0b75f8a.mp4?t=1772250147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Controls, Instant Addiction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Gameplay is super simple \u2013 every level follows a &quot;one-key&quot; philosophy. This core design lets your fingers react before your brain can think, getting your body hooked on the rhythm instantly! You can even command the rhythm at your fingertips \u2013 eyes closed!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eccentric Cast, Hilarious Tales</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 The hotel is packed with bizarre guests from across history and the globe, each bringing their laugh-out-loud stories and unique &quot;signature rhythm skills&quot;. Embark on a nonsensical rhythm adventure where every tap triggers unexpected surprises!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ever-Evolving Rhythm Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Each level presents a different type of rhythmic challenge. Test your sense of rhythm, rhythmic memory, and precision across increasingly complex mechanics, pushing your rhythmic mastery to the limit!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Musical Universe, Endless Possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Dive into a world of diverse global music styles \u2013 from pumping EDM and retro disco to brain-worm pop hits and quirky sound effects, any genre can become a rhythm playground! A future \u300clevel editor\u300dwill unleash your creativity: design your own absurd stories and addictive rhythm challenges for players worldwide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/extras/39bd794fbac3c97f62f6f36fe7eccd99.poster.avif?t=1772250147\" width=1170 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/extras/39bd794fbac3c97f62f6f36fe7eccd99.webm?t=1772250147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/extras/39bd794fbac3c97f62f6f36fe7eccd99.mp4?t=1772250147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Message from the Devs:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 We\u2019re an three-person indie studio that started with rhythm games but dreams beyond them. We want to push the boundaries of the genre, exploring how rhythm can fuse with different mechanics, styles, and emotions. Close your eyes, catch the beat with your ears, let your fingers dance to the melody. Open them, and you will find that every tap triggers an unexpected story twist. We hope \u300cRhythm Hotel\u300ddelivers a truly fresh experience to everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 The game is currently in development, targeting a release by year's end. If you like our game, please <strong>\u300cWishlist it now\u300d</strong>! Your support means the world to us \u2013 it's the fuel for our late-night crunch sessions!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Joy Above All! We craft games to deliver pure delight in the simplest way!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/extras/1a198d3488b20cd7edb7cd1ab948c326.poster.avif?t=1772250147\" width=1170 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/extras/1a198d3488b20cd7edb7cd1ab948c326.webm?t=1772250147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/extras/1a198d3488b20cd7edb7cd1ab948c326.mp4?t=1772250147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3253930?t=1772250147","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3253930?t=1772250147","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/49acfb01da4298f3d96b85edfe4531491b34d3ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772250147","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/49acfb01da4298f3d96b85edfe4531491b34d3ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772250147","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3803790,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Follow Me</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X\uff1a@Rhythm_Hotel </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord\uff1aENet75YjE7</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/extras/1349382a6f0b61e90b43390e4fe9511c.poster.avif?t=1772250147\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/extras/1349382a6f0b61e90b43390e4fe9511c.webm?t=1772250147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/extras/1349382a6f0b61e90b43390e4fe9511c.mp4?t=1772250147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 \u300cRhythm Hotel\u300dis a rhythm game bursting with wildly unpredictable, absurdly hilarious storylines. Socrates' &quot;kicking the donkey&quot; philosophy, Zhang Fei who said &quot;Me too!&quot; during the Oath of the Peach Garden, Einstein photographed only from the waist up.\u00a0The playable demo offers a taste of the bizarre, darkly humorous rhythm challenges waiting inside this fantastical inn bursting with whimsy and beats. The full version will deliver over 20 wildly unique rhythm mini-games, each with its own ridiculous story!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Step into \ud83c\udfb5Rhythm Hotel\ud83c\udfb5 \u2014 where every tap launches a rhythm-fueled adventure!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/extras/08d6420fd8a28b607f9f314ae0b75f8a.poster.avif?t=1772250147\" width=1170 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/extras/08d6420fd8a28b607f9f314ae0b75f8a.webm?t=1772250147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/extras/08d6420fd8a28b607f9f314ae0b75f8a.mp4?t=1772250147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Controls, Instant Addiction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Gameplay is super simple \u2013 every level follows a &quot;one-key&quot; philosophy. This core design lets your fingers react before your brain can think, getting your body hooked on the rhythm instantly! You can even command the rhythm at your fingertips \u2013 eyes closed!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eccentric Cast, Hilarious Tales</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 The hotel is packed with bizarre guests from across history and the globe, each bringing their laugh-out-loud stories and unique &quot;signature rhythm skills&quot;. Embark on a nonsensical rhythm adventure where every tap triggers unexpected surprises!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ever-Evolving Rhythm Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Each level presents a different type of rhythmic challenge. Test your sense of rhythm, rhythmic memory, and precision across increasingly complex mechanics, pushing your rhythmic mastery to the limit!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Musical Universe, Endless Possibilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Dive into a world of diverse global music styles \u2013 from pumping EDM and retro disco to brain-worm pop hits and quirky sound effects, any genre can become a rhythm playground! A future \u300clevel editor\u300dwill unleash your creativity: design your own absurd stories and addictive rhythm challenges for players worldwide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/extras/39bd794fbac3c97f62f6f36fe7eccd99.poster.avif?t=1772250147\" width=1170 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/extras/39bd794fbac3c97f62f6f36fe7eccd99.webm?t=1772250147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/extras/39bd794fbac3c97f62f6f36fe7eccd99.mp4?t=1772250147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Message from the Devs:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 We\u2019re an three-person indie studio that started with rhythm games but dreams beyond them. We want to push the boundaries of the genre, exploring how rhythm can fuse with different mechanics, styles, and emotions. Close your eyes, catch the beat with your ears, let your fingers dance to the melody. Open them, and you will find that every tap triggers an unexpected story twist. We hope \u300cRhythm Hotel\u300ddelivers a truly fresh experience to everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 The game is currently in development, targeting a release by year's end. If you like our game, please <strong>\u300cWishlist it now\u300d</strong>! Your support means the world to us \u2013 it's the fuel for our late-night crunch sessions!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Joy Above All! We craft games to deliver pure delight in the simplest way!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/extras/1a198d3488b20cd7edb7cd1ab948c326.poster.avif?t=1772250147\" width=1170 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/extras/1a198d3488b20cd7edb7cd1ab948c326.webm?t=1772250147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/extras/1a198d3488b20cd7edb7cd1ab948c326.mp4?t=1772250147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["SyncArc-Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253930/2e628234816e9156f8d5d457aa1a9c2bc56048e3/header.jpg?t=1772250147","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mojave 10.14+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon\u6216Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"h